# UPDATED 2026-09-10: the version DOI below was read directly from the live Zenodo record
# (zenodo.org/records/22699905) for the v1.0.3 release, not copied from the GitHub-Zenodo
# integration widget or assumed. v1.0.0's own version DOI (10.5281/zenodo.22652327) remains
